        "payload": "tree 58712664a873e35f5137c3a6d65756e62567563c\nparent f26c15bdd28f532f95ead48736146d88b66bbea7\nauthor sedited <seb.kung@gmail.com> 1782906304 +0200\ncommitter sedited <seb.kung@gmail.com> 1783003035 +0200\n\nkernel: Add script tracer\n\nThis adds a callback hook to the kernel library C header for getting the\ncurrent script execution state on each script evaluation step. This can\nbe used for debugging scripts and gives external applications a view\ninto how Bitcoin Core does script evaluation.\n\nThis feature is gated behind the ENABLE_SCRIPT_TRACE flag. To compile\nwith the feature enabled, pass `-DENABLE_SCRIPT_TRACE=ON`. If the feature\nis not manually enabled, the trace hooks are stubbed out.\n\nThe traces are divided into separate frames. RAII is used to guarantee\nthat every script execution has at least its start and end state\ncaptured. Each instruction generates a unique frame as well.\n\nThe ScriptError in the VerifyScript invocation run when calling\nscript_pubkey_verify is added in order to be able to surface the error\ncode in the trace frames.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEE8s/Eq9C5nYN+67fQm3m0VpHbQXMFAmpGd5wACgkQm3m0VpHb\nQXNVeRAAlm2Q1Eewez+oqwezcUqlYZqvJYZ1OBOOdtwKmNnBRx13hen3mS56om2J\ncANSnVGw8HUWyAMa4/rsHDl1zyH+sHk4hXCmrH+z8PFF8ITOxDMXL4cq/ZwtFhg/\nIKaEXVe4vBDi54dYV8sqwyX4fq0naCxhY0ZfA6W+KGfZ2CqrtoZWrEAgGWISRsM+\nHCdxGgE71mZXbt3EvzMLl2CBQ5KO4PfvuhoHvDfrz0R2zWI0g56BYgfTyKiqzE8c\ndBBhybDa6Ky0xv5dEjs3dpWioPuPTYFuMYGpWiODU/0fA8be4z3msun68E7Yy3Ic\nnSPNOP6sAfN4gPJQ9/uQb+k7mindwvgU6r6QPnxR+3a5UT+z80SoFe87F4Vg7kWt\nZLX6g23OmJzBetTyPH4aMkIi7xFoS11ZR2/lLrnAjfroDqDbKzxs96opb/+aaNcA\nmyZIZR62ok/YxySc2IeFNb5pgEeQ1+W2ea2qH/n6cm01a5agV7jyRoXZF2PdARcW\nKqI6mj97a+2jlnqX13gKBfeOEES/Rb8DoPgYIk/zshXGahN90SmYOK26yUxx+JJt\nO9bK/ukuMfNpJuueGkLnbbLEIwQabpk1Q/mBJCFZQ4ZyCfMuKZN7DSX72fSX7joj\nxX66Z7VDUkQmIsPypHi7LxLvs+yGb9O4dibBGP5uRZt1JIRqP/c=\n=wym5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
